member.summary:
Treats the current error as unrecoverable and returns a ,
which has to be thrown manually

Usage: throw err.Panic();

example.code:
public enum IOErr
{
    [ErrMsg("File {path} Do Not Exist")]
    [ErrArg("path", typeof(string), "Path that was not found")]
    NotFound,
}

// The above automatically generates IOErr_NotFound : Err<IOErr>
var err = new IOErr_NotFound("a.txt");
